|% Example 11: a document of a project that uses the shared library ua-iban.
|% lib is a symbolic link to ../shared/ua-iban (decision 136): the build gives
|% warning P2639 once — the library is outside the project, keep it together
|% with the project. iban.check() stops the build if the IBAN is wrong.
|import("lib/iban")
|<(number=False) Рахунок на оплату

Постачальник: |(постачальник).

IBAN: |(iban.grouped(рахунок)) (код банку |(iban.bank_code(рахунок))).

До сплати: |(money_full(сума, "UAH")).
